This project is derived from quantumlib/tesseract-decoder (Google LLC, Apache-2.0).
Original notices and LICENSE are retained. CPU algorithm and CUDA backend
changes are supplied in this research release. CUDA variants are separate from
the upstream package. Superdense Color circuits were generated with the official
quantumlib/chromobius generator; generator commit is recorded in circuits.json.
Historical benchmark provenance is supplied for attribution and reproducibility.
